  "body": "Freehold House for Sale — Private Sale\r\n\r\nPrime Edward Avenue Location, Orewa\r\n\r\nEnjoy relaxed coastal living in this beautifully presented, single-level home, ideally positioned on highly sought-after Edward Avenue. Set on a flat section and just a four-minute walk from beautiful Orewa Beach and Orewa Town, this attractive JG Gardiner brick-and-tile residence offers comfort, convenience, and easy-care living.\r\n\r\nTastefully decorated throughout, the home features three bedrooms, two bathrooms, and a double garage, with neutral colours and a bright, welcoming atmosphere.\r\n\r\nThe spacious open-plan lounge, dining, and kitchen area is filled with natural light and opens seamlessly through doors to the outdoor entertaining spaces. With decks at both the front and rear, covered pergolas, and a covered side patio, there are plenty of options for enjoying the outdoors in all weather conditions.\r\n\r\nThe fully enclosed, maintenance-free landscaped garden includes a practical Keter garden shed, while security gates, screen doors, and insect screens provide added comfort and peace of mind.\r\n\r\nProperty highlights\r\n\r\n* Single-storey home on a flat section\r\n* Three bedrooms and two bathrooms\r\n* Double internal-access garage\r\n* Bright open-plan lounge, dining, and kitchen\r\n* Two outdoor decks with covered pergolas\r\n* Covered side patio\r\n* Fully enclosed, low-maintenance landscaped garden\r\n* Keter garden shed\r\n* Four-minute walk to Orewa Beach and Orewa Town\r\n* Neutral décor throughout\r\n* Keyless Entry\r\n* Furniture and appliances available as an optional extra\r\n\r\nChattels and features\r\n\r\n* Fisher & Paykel stove with electric oven and gas hob\r\n* Rangehood\r\n* Dishwasher\r\n* Gas Central Heating\r\n* Heat pumps and ceiling fans\r\n* DVS ventilation system\r\n* Heated towel rails\r\n* Burglar alarm and smoke alarm\r\n* Wood slat and roller blinds\r\n* Curtains \r\n* LED lights\r\n* Wool carpets, laminate wood, and tiled flooring\r\n* Remote-controlled garage door\r\n* Security gates, screen doors, and insect screens\r\n\r\nPerfectly suited to families, downsizers, retirees, or those seeking a lock-up-and-leave coastal lifestyle, this exceptional Orewa property is an opportunity not to be missed.\r\n\r\nContact: 4judymary@gmail.com or 0212139085 today to arrange your private viewing.\r\n\r\n**Strictly by appointment only\r\n\r\n**Offers over $1,500,000\r\n\r\n**Furniture and Appliances are an optional extra.",
